bulk_extraction_tests.cpp (13)
 - bulk_extraction options default to serial extraction
 - bulk_extraction rejects zero workers as an outer argument error
 - bulk_extraction rejects unsupported large worker counts as an outer argument error
 - bulk_extraction preserves request order and bytes in serial and parallel mode
 - bulk_extraction coalesces duplicate successes in serial mode
 - bulk_extraction coalesces duplicate successes in parallel mode
 - bulk_extraction mirrors duplicate missing path failures without aborting siblings
 - bulk_extraction mirrors duplicate sink factory failures without aborting siblings
 - bulk_extraction does not pre-merge distinct request strings
 - bulk_extraction records per-entry failures without aborting siblings
 - bulk_extraction records partial sink writes as per-entry I/O errors
 - bulk_extraction streams large raw archive families through bounded chunks
 - bulk_extraction source policy documents raw chunking and compressed allocation boundaries
